Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.61,0:00:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where... am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A pig in a straw house... It's as if...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine, juicy little piggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, I'm so glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshino? What's that outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I was in it when I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.64,0:02:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told to bring this to Grandma's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.23,0:02:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit power and Angels don't work here,\Nso we just went with the flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm one of the\NThree Little Pigs, so I'm thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. If this is Grandma's house\Nin {\i1}Little Red Riding Hood{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What a good little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did you come, but you brought\Na tasty piggy with you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma's gone beast mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna gobble both of you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Shido?! Yoshino?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka... Nia...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka! Give 'em one of those\Nmillet dumplings on your belt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,These?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, I'm so sorry!\NI get like that when I'm hangry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.89,0:04:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Momotaro's\Nmillet dumplings for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew dumplings did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia, what in the world is this?\NWere we swallowed by Beelzebub?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,More like we're in a world\Nthat was created by Beelzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Which story are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, me? I'm Fatima from {\i1}Silver Bullet{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your own fricken manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we get back to our world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Westcott's not gonna let us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.51,0:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means we've gotta find someone\Nwith the power to break us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone that convenient here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The others should be\Nsomewhere in this world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori! Hey, Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Concern. She won't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case... Oh, Shido! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Request. Kotori's in danger.\NShe needs a cardiac massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's the big idea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uh... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We fooled you, Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreement. I figured Shido's name\Nmight wake you by the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:47.99,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Ratatoskr"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm the Little Match Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.62,0:05:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be Westcott's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a vision? It's so real!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder! Even Shido is in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori's feelings for Shido must've\Nmade their way into her dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's supposed to be her dead grandma!\NAnyway, what's your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we knew it,\Nwe found ourselves in a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After walking a bit,\Nwe came upon a candy house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Explanation. Since we were hungry,\Nwe snacked on the walls and roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A-ha. Hansel and Gretel, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A creepy hag tried talking to us,\Nbut we ignored her and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreement. She chased us\Nwith terrifying speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But nobody can keep pace with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth. Kaguya had tears in her eyes\Nand may have peed herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't pee myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gotta find the others\Nand get back to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, where do we even start?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So many carriages today. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard they're revealing something\Namazing at the castle ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.09,0:07:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The emperor captured\Na mermaid and plans to show it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it sings, "Darling! Darling!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Scattered battles around base!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.15,0:07:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,DEM Wizards and Bandersnatch confirmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--The Commander?!\N--Can't reach her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,God help us! Misty help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In times like this, losing your cool\Nis more dangerous than the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I know the crew's\Ncapabilities better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well. You stole my thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Like MARIA said, let's stay calm.\NHave we heard from base?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Woodman is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.06,0:08:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's urging us to take Fraxinus\Nand head to Zodiac.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, let's protect it\Nuntil Kotori and the others return.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage to our hull!\NEnemies have breached the hangar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,MARIA, set Territory to 50\Nand activate jamming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Acknowledged. Deploying Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Territory neutralized the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's deadly to machines that move\Nby generative magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:08:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Vice Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.97,0:09:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, it's just Territory.\NIt won't stop humans and bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Move and we'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.23,0:09:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Fraxinus...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Westcott will be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank MARIA for that projection!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Mi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Misty? Misty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt my Misty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakatsugawa, Shiizaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.34,0:10:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen the usefulness\Nof figures and straw dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm granting permission\Nto bring them on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Misty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa. That castle\Nsure shouts "fairy tale."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of people come through here,\Nso we might learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.87,0:10:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let us in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,--Meanie!\N--Stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori? Kaguya! Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido! You're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's with the outfits?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to see the castle's mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.81,0:11:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it cries out, "Darling! Darling!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But this guard is a doofus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Upset. He won't let us through!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not! You're not\Ngetting past me dressed like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.39,0:11:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, these are my attendants.\NMay they enter with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, but...! That's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mind, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... G-Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You little..! Get your witchcraft\Noutta here and don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So Natsun's Cinderella, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,"Natsun"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Grr! At this rate,\Nwe'll just have to use force!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreement. With our numbers,\Nwe don't need Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up. Let's be smart about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:46.95,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Ratatoskr"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever thinking, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the candle go out\Nor we'll go back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I in a dress, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes it easier\Nto get into the ball, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fancy castle.\NThat's Cinderella's ball for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the mermaid?\NI don't see it anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, look to the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.70,0:13:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to behold\Nthe song of the mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,--Miku!\N--Miku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling! Everyone! What lovely dresses!\NAnd Darling's in Shiori mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fill me in on the details!\NDid anyone think to record it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:14:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Calm down. Anyway,\Nhow did you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I knew it, I was in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But an evil witch said she'd make me\Nhuman in exchange for my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So {\i1}The Little Mermaid{\i}, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're still a mermaid...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup! I'd never let anyone take my voice,\Nso I smacked her with my tail and fled!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, fishermen\Ncaught me on the beach...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.51,0:14:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.81,0:14:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,--Wha--?!\N--Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,--Th-That's the rumored...\N--What a wonderful outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly! It's like a veil of mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, everyone... I'm glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.74,0:14:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. But... are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How to put it...?\NYou didn't get mugged, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami! What kind of\Noutfit is that?! You're naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.22,0:15:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she insult the emperor's clothes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.06,0:15:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it from wandering tailors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Those without love for Shido can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you can't see it, Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?! H-Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,M-My, what splendid skin-like clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to fake it, Tohka.\NIt's {\i1}The Emperor's New Clothes{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.37,0:15:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Emperor's New Clothes{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't think it strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When they said you can't see it without\Nlove, I thought I caught of glimpse of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is good.\NWe're all together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:16:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And Origami is emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.43,0:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She can use her power to search\Nthe lands for a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"Superhero"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. There might be someone powerful\Nwho can return us to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.49,0:16:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,True. With my power,\NI can issue a search of the lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We might find an item or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! We'll get back\Nto our world in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start right away and--!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be! Ogres from Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't coming,\Nso we came to find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:17:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's mine. A monster from\N{\i1}Silver Bullet{\i} revives in Part 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.83,0:17:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,gets powerful in Part 3, and\Ncomes for revenge on Fatima.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those damn recurring villains!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! We can't use our Spirit\Npower here! We won't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Would not the Spirits you "save"\Nbe exposed to greater peril?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, I tire hearing of this hypocrisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:47.96,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Little Red Riding Hood"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a neighborhood high schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,--That's... Shido?\N--What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.85,0:18:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! He's from the manga we drew!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! 'Cuz this world\Nis a mix of stories!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not unusual for the "Shido"\Nfrom our manga to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's more, he's like\NShido Itsuka, but not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a manga hero!\NHe's both super cool and super strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. Thanks, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.80,0:18:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're starting to sound like Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good. If you're all here,\NI take it Westcott's involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That saves the explanation.\NCan we return to our world somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get back as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.77,0:18:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:19:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This world was made by a Demon King,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,which means it can be broken by an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I may be fiction, while in\Nthis world, my Angel's the real deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go through here to get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.47,0:19:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What's up, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to help\Nthis Spirit named Mukuro, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.49,0:19:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You have doubts:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"If I hadn't sealed the Spirits' powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,they wouldn't face so much danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I made the wrong choice."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.71,0:20:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, because you're me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I'd go help that Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mukuro wants to be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.89,0:20:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but doesn't it seem strange to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She locked her heart to not be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that mean she was sad enough\Nat one point to resort to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.53,0:20:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Her words sound like an SOS to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, what is it I want for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.29,0:20:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,"What is it I want for her?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You're right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, high schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too, neighborhood high schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Took long enough, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:21:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?\NDid you talk with the other Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just a bit. But I'm fine now.\NLet's go save Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get to Mukuro quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to launch!\NRealizers in parallel drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy Territory in avoid mode!\NFraxinus Excelsior, lift off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.75,0:21:55.00,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 05:\N'Fairy Tale'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fraxinus gets a new life,\Nbut blocking their way is Ellen in Goetia.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How will this fated showdown end?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "An Opened Heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:39.98,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 06: 'An Opened Heart"'
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.43,0:23:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido and Mukuro's destiny awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.94,0:23:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.94,0:23:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,
